---
// The freeze frame's amber light: fills the story's "accent-freeze" slot, over the portrait and
// under the text. Invisible until the camera raises it; without scripts it never shows.
---

<div class="flash" data-flash aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .flash {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: var(--amber);
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
</style>
